# The build context is the repository root (every service copies its own
# subtree). Without these exclusions the daemon ships node_modules, Maven
# output and git history over the socket, which is slow and pointless: the
# images build their dependencies themselves, and the frontend installs the
# workspace from the lockfile inside the build stage.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.git
.env
**/*.log
